The files in this folder are the page kit of tasteskill 2.5.1 (the design-taste-frontend
skill), copied unmodified from the copy of the skill kept in this repository at
.claude/skills/design-taste-frontend/assets (see .claude/skills/design-taste-frontend/NOTICE).

  Source   https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill  (folder: skills/taste-skill)
  Version  tasteskill 2.5.1, commit 952435f63acece7d2fcb4b4d3c1786c1c43603e0
  Licence  MIT, see LICENSE in this folder. Copyright (c) 2026 Leonxlnx.

Copied here, at the kit's own relative paths so its references resolve:

  system.css, system.js
  ui/cards.css, ui/ui.js, ui/base.css
  motion/motion.css, motion/motion.js
  backgrounds/backgrounds.css
  layout/layout.css
  icons/icon.css
  effects/fx.js, effects/halftone-screen/effect.js, effects/halftone-screen/meta.json
  moments/moments.js, moments/lib.js
  moments/word-highlight/moment.js, moment.css, meta.json
  moments/liquid-type/moment.js, moment.css, meta.json

The front page (app/page.tsx) is the only page that runs the scripts above: the halftone-screen
effect in its hero and the two moments (word-highlight, liquid-type).

The site loads the stylesheets into the cascade layer "kit" (app/layout.tsx), so the site's
own styles and every Tailwind utility win over them. Do not edit these files: replace them
with the same files from a newer copy of the skill, and change the version above.
